                modalClose: "Close",
                
                // Modal Content
                modal_fish_title: "My Role as a Fish Entrepreneur",
                modal_fish_text: "Despite long experience as a Manpower Executive, I am involved in the fish business through personal initiative. My core skills in this sector as an entrepreneur include effective planning (Plan Making) and developing marketing strategies. I analyze local market demands, work closely to maintain fish quality, and strengthen customer relationships by ensuring supply at the right price. This business has given me practical experience in supply chain management, rapid decision-making, and creating new business opportunities even in challenging situations, proving my versatile capabilities.",
                modal_herdsman_title: "Livestock Rearing, Management and Herdsman Life",
                modal_herdsman_text: "Alongside my professional and entrepreneurial identity, I am an experienced Herdsman. This role has taught me a deep understanding of nature and the animal lifecycle. My skills include: managing animal health and feed, proper grazing land planning, ensuring the safety of the herd in adverse conditions, and monitoring rural resources. The experience of herding has strengthened my strategic planning, observation skills, and patience, which are also invaluable for my administrative work.",
                modal_cattle_title: "Cattle Trading, Marketing & Livestock Selection",
                modal_cattle_text: "As a Cattle Trader, I am highly proficient in market analysis and economic risk assessment for buying and selling profitable livestock. My main skills are: selecting healthy and high-quality cattle breeds, negotiating fair prices, and successfully bringing animals to market to ensure sales. This work reflects my financial acumen, communication skills, and ability to make quick decisions in challenging environments. This is an important aspect of my multifaceted entrepreneurial mindset.",
                modal_livestock_title: "Livestock Rearing and Farm Management",
                modal_livestock_text: "As a Livestock Farmer, my primary skills involve close monitoring and care of animal health, nutrition, and reproductive cycles. I use a combination of modern methods and traditional knowledge to properly nurture the livestock. This includes: implementing disease prevention measures, adjusting diets, and improving the overall operational efficiency of the farm. This role demonstrates my long-term planning, daily supervision, and responsibility towards living resources.",
                modal_fundraising_title: "Fundraising for Social Causes (Fundraiser)",
                modal_fundraising_text: "I personally take the initiative to raise funds for various humanitarian and social causes. When an urgent social initiative or need arises, I reach out to people for help. This role highlights my strong interpersonal communication skills, credibility, and sensitivity to human needs. Through fundraising, I ensure that underprivileged people or initiatives in society receive the right help as needed. This work is an integral part of my humanitarian values and leadership qualities.",
                modal_phuchka_title: "Phuchka Business Operations (Street Food Venture)",
                modal_phuchka_text: "I operate as an experienced Phuchka vendor, providing high-quality street food to customers. This work has given me skills in direct customer interaction, rapid food preparation, hygiene management, and immediate cash transactions. It proves my entrepreneurial mindset to quickly start and manage a small business. The experience of running this business in front of schools or crowded areas helps me understand customer demands and achieve their satisfaction while maintaining quality.",
                modal_social_participant_title: "Active Participation in Social Welfare Activities",
                modal_social_participant_text: "I actively participate as a volunteer in various social and collective activities. This work allows me the opportunity to work collaboratively in teams, take initiative to solve local challenges, and contribute to public awareness. My participation in organizational events, promotional activities, or direct groundwork demonstrates my leadership qualities, problem-solving abilities, and my commitment to society.",
                modal_agricultural_worker_title: "Agricultural Work and Rural Farming Management",
                modal_agricultural_worker_text: "My rural life experience includes direct participation in agricultural work. This experience has given me practical knowledge about seasonal crop cultivation, seed planting, soil fertility preservation, pest control, and the use of both traditional and modern farming methods. Agricultural work has increased my mindset for hard work, patience, and proper management of natural resources, which helps maintain discipline and focus in any task.",
                modal_carpenter_title: "My Experience and Skills as a Carpenter",
                modal_carpenter_text: "I have experience working with wood as a carpenter. Through this work, I have acquired skills in cutting wood, designing, making and repairing furniture, and creating wooden structures. This job requires precision, patience, and accurate knowledge of measurement, which reflects my ability to solve problems and apply practical solutions. Carpentry work is a practical testament to my versatile skills.",
                modal_farmer_title: "My Role and Experience as a Farmer",
                modal_farmer_text: "As a farmer, I directly engage in cultivating land, planting crops, caring for them, and harvesting. This role involves practical knowledge of creating plans according to seasonal changes, selecting seeds, managing irrigation, and correctly applying pesticides. This experience provides me with skills in working with nature, committing to hard physical labor, and tackling production challenges, which is proof of my patience and resilience.",
                modal_construction_labour_title: "Hard Labour and Construction Knowledge as a Labourer",
                modal_construction_labour_text: "I have experience working as a construction labourer on various construction sites. My main skills in this role include: carrying heavy materials, mixing and using construction materials (like cement, sand), assisting with primary structural work, and strictly following safety regulations. This hard physical work demonstrates my team collaboration, commitment to finishing work on time, and high physical endurance.",
                modal_bus_contractor_title: "Transport Contracts and Route Management as a Bus Contractor",
                modal_bus_contractor_text: "As a Bus Contractor, I have experience successfully executing passenger transport routes and bus operation contracts. This job requires rapid route planning, scheduling, maintaining effective communication with passengers, and taking quick action in unexpected situations. This role demonstrates my high level of organizational ability, negotiation skills, and basic knowledge of transport/logistics.",
                modal_potter_title: "My Creativity as a Potter",
                modal_potter_text: "I have a deep connection with clay, and as a potter, I give that connection an artistic form. This work has taught me patience, focus, and creativity. From shaping the clay on the wheel to firing it, every step is a form of meditation. This experience has taught me how to create extraordinary beauty from ordinary things, which also inspires me in all my other work.",
                modal_egg_seller_title: "My Experience as an Egg Seller",
                modal_egg_seller_text: "The egg business is a fast-paced and demanding sector. In this role, I was responsible for collecting eggs from the wholesale market, checking their quality, and supplying them at the retail level. This has given me skills in supply chain management, building customer relationships, and making quick decisions based on market demand. This experience has further enhanced my business acumen.",
                modal_writer_title: "My Journey as a Poet and Writer",
                modal_writer_text: "Writing is my passion and a medium for self-expression. As a poet and writer, I shape feelings and thoughts with words. My poetry and writings are centered around various social, psychological, and philosophical themes. This creative work has strengthened my observational skills, linguistic abilities, and imagination, helping me to think deeply in any situation.",
